=head1 NAME

linux_file_descriptors - Monitor Linux system-wide file descriptor usage

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This Munin plugin monitors system-wide Linux file descriptor counters
from /proc/sys/fs/file-nr.

It reports:

- Allocated file descriptors
- Unused file descriptors
- Maximum file descriptors

The plugin is intended for Linux servers where file descriptor usage
needs to be monitored.

=head1 AUTHOR

iServerSupport

For Linux server management and infrastructure support:
